From a0c66a698f529bb5b69721d2688844ef96bcecde Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Ryan X. Charles" <ryan@ryanxcharles.com>
Date: Sat, 19 Sep 2026 10:56:35 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Bundle GN highlighting and native grammar

Old bindings retire their runtime coat;
Hex dollars escape the scanners moat.
The build files glow, the headers stay,
And Ninja sleeps through test-run day.
